## Intervals.icu (read-only: athlete profile, wellness, activities, workout library, calendar)
## Local development only — never commit a real key here.
## Get your personal API key from Intervals.icu > Settings > Developer.
INTERVALS_API_KEY=

## Open-Meteo location for the development planning backend (no API key).
## Set explicit decimal coordinates and an IANA timezone, e.g. America/Toronto.
## The timezone also defines the upcoming planning week for Calendar.
TRAINIQ_WEATHER_LATITUDE=
TRAINIQ_WEATHER_LONGITUDE=
TRAINIQ_WEATHER_TIMEZONE=
